  "limits": [
    "beta1 device crash confirmed in ShadeManager init -> FBSOrientationObserver setHandler: -> objc_msgSend. Callback registration removed.",
    "Native Clang 23 + Apple ld64 956.6 arm64e build; no ABI converter. New build still needs physical-device validation.",
    "Desktop app and manual renderer loading are separate. Overlay does not automatically start after respring.",
    "Focused foreground application only; polling interval 0.2 seconds; lock screen, app switcher and settings app hidden.",
    "0.2.0 device feedback: desktop app opened but overlay was absent even without app filtering; exact device-side cause remains unconfirmed.",
    "User confirmed 0.3.0 works on device; 0.3.1 adds app-switcher hiding and needs device verification.",
    "0.4.0 adds searchable app icons and explicit per-app enable switches; icon availability and UI need device verification.",
    "0.5.1 fixes landscape transforms, adds gravity-oriented panel, 24-point partly offscreen icon, and a 10 percent opacity floor; physical-device validation pending.",
    "0.5.0 adds floating icon, modal quick settings, bar visibility/interaction controls and pinch opacity control; UIKit touch routing and pinch opacity updates still require device verification.",
    "Each app has an independent profile: 1-120 percent width/height, color/opacity, and separate portrait/landscape centers.",
    "Dragging changes position only and may move the bar fully off screen; the app reset centers both orientations without changing size or appearance."
  ]
